<title>USA: TRO Learning Inc Q2 April 30 loss widens.</title>
<headline>TRO Learning Inc Q2 April 30 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>HOFFMAN ESTATES, Ill. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Unaudited, in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				 Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					    April 30	 April 30</p>
<p>				   1997	  1996     1997     1996</p>
<p> Total revenues	     7,600	 6,741   12,687   13,150</p>
<p> Cost of revenues	   1,351	   632    2,131    1,846</p>
<p> Gross profit		 6,249	 6,109   10,556   11,304</p>
<p> Total oper expenses	9,596	 7,403   17,332   14,135</p>
